  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/IMG_4489.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(8 fotos) El F&ograve;rum C&iacute;vic de Suera ha celebrat el cap de setmana passat el seu debat anual, dedicat en aquesta ocasi&oacute; a Viol&egrave;ncia de g&egrave;nere i viol&egrave;ncia dom&egrave;stica. Amb presentaci&oacute;&nbsp;a c&agrave;rrec de l&#39;alcalde, Jos&eacute; Mart&iacute; Garcia, han intervingut Josep Arrandis Garcia, antrop&ograve;leg i treballador social, i Ana Mar&iacute;a Juli&aacute;n Edo, t&egrave;cnica en igualtat.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/forumcivicsuera15/img_4488.jpg\" alt=\"img_4488\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/forumcivicsuera15/img_4489.jpg\" alt=\"img_4489\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/forumcivicsuera15/img_4491.jpg\" alt=\"img_4491\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/forumcivicsuera15/img_4494.jpg\" alt=\"img_4494\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/forumcivicsuera15/img_4496.jpg\" alt=\"img_4496\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/forumcivicsuera15/img_4497.jpg\" alt=\"img_4497\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/forumcivicsuera15/img_4500.jpg\" alt=\"img_4500\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/forumcivicsuera15/img_4501.jpg\" alt=\"img_4501\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
